    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19713" root="سطر" body-key="s">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطَرَ</span></b> , (S, M, Msb, &amp;c.,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطُرَ</span></b> , (S, M, Msb;)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطْرٌ</span>; (S, M, Msb, K; *) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سطّر</span></b> ; (M;)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استطر</span></b> ; (S, M, A, Msb, K;) <i>He wrote</i> (S,
M, * A, Msb, K) a writing or book. (M, Msb.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطَرَ</span> <i>He ruled</i> a book. (See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِسْطَرَةٌ</span>.)]
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطَرَ</span>, (TA,) inf. n. as above, (K, TA,)
(tropical:)  <i>He cut</i> another man <i>with a sword.</i> (K, * TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطَرَهُ</span> <i>He prostrated him; threw him
down prostrate.</i> (S.)

